WEBVTT

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:07.650
LDS's fourth duelist showed me 
overwhelming power and skills.

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.250
Fusion Summon!

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.250
Be born, D/D/D Flame King Genghis!

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:17.900
Synchro Summon!

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:24.050
Be born, Level 7 D/D/D Gust King Alexander!

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.570
Xyz Summon!

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:32.700
Be born, Rank 4 Wave King Caesar!

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:38.780
Let's battle.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:42.550
Flame King Genghis attacks Whip Snake!

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:48.390
I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell Hippo Carnival!

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:52.000
I Special Summon three Hippo 
Tokens in defense position.

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:58.470
And your monster is only allowed 
to attack Hippo Tokens!

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:06.650
All right!  He was able 
to protect Whip Snake!

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:08.780
Nice response, Yuya!

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:14.190
Next, Gust King Alexander 
attacks Hippo Token!

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.090
Alexander's effect now activates.

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:29.000
Once per turn, when it destroys a monster in 
battle, another one of your monsters is destroyed.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:38.600
Go!  Wave King Caesar, attack!

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:40.900
Bury Whip Snake!

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:50.090
Whip Snake!

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:58.460
Damn!  He destroyed every single one!

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:01.700
I set one card and end my turn.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:05.850
You're incredible when you're serious.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:09.700
I'm surprised that you've mastered 
three summoning methods.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.250
It's my turn!

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:19.000
I can't Fusion or Synchro or Xyz, but 
there's a power that only I have!

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.550
The fun is only getting started!

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:29.190
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:37.370
In duels where the field, monsters and duelists 
become one, the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:41.370
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:57.060 --> 00:03:00.150
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:03.560
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.300
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:16.870
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.070
Impulse  Got it got it

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:24.280
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:35.040
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:41.960
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:45.900
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:49.300
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:59.580
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.920
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:12.970
D/D Savant Galilei and Kepler

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:16.440
The fun is only getting started!

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:18.360
It's here!

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:22.470
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:26.270
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:32.620
Yuya Sakaki will show you entertainment 
dueling that only he can do!

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:35.640
I was waiting for this!

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:43.960
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:04:58.010 --> 00:05:03.190
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:05.880
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:08.850
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:13.300
Pendulum Summon!  Come out, my monsters!

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.730
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:27.070
And my new teammate Performapal 
Fire Mufflerlion!

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:31.670
There it is!  Pendulum Summon!

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:33.560
A new monster also appeared!

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.160
It gives me shivers!

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.270
Counterattack, Yuya!

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.250
Go!

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.320
I'm counting on you, Yuya!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:43.270
Everyone, please pay attention!

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:50.610
My troupe's superstar Odd-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon will perform some fire tricks!

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:58.840
Let's go, Odd-Eyes!

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:01.070
Let's battle!

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:04.610
Attack Flame King Genghis!

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:08.870
Burn everything you see with 
your different-colored eyes!

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.590
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:22.900
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon's effect activates!

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:28.640
When it battles a Level 5-or-above 
monster, battle damage is doubled!

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:31.300
Reaction Force!

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:41.900
Yeah!  500 times 2 is 1000 points of damage!

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:43.590
He turned the tables!

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:48.790
Fire Mufflerlion's effect activates!

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:58.160
When it's in attack position, the Pendulum Monster that destroyed your 
monster gains 200 attack points until the end of battle and can attack again!

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:03.840
Go through that ring of flames, Odd-Eyes!

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:12.990
It went through a ring of flames!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:16.160
I can't believe he used that 
technique to power it up!

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:20.420
He's a beast master - I 
mean - a dragon master!

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:22.130
This is real entertainment!

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:23.470
I'm burning up, Yuya!

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:24.990
My blood is on fire!

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:29.060
The second attack will be 
against Gust King Alexander!

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:32.030
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:39.360
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon's effect activates!

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:41.270
Reaction Force!

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:49.960
I'm shivering so much that I can't take it!

00:07:56.890 --> 00:07:59.870
I'm on my game today!

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:02.960
I activate the Action Spell Wonder Chance!

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:06.800
One monster gets an additional attack!

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:10.000
Do it, Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.530
Attack Wave King Caesar!

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:26.870
He did it!  He destroyed them all!

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:30.490
And he took away 1700 
life points in one turn!

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:33.340
I'm shivering so much!

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:34.870
He can win!

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:41.370
Even if the opponent uses three summoning methods, Yuya 
will protect You Show School as long as he has Pendulum Summon!

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:42.960
I'm burning up, Yuya!

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:46.070
You're the ace of You Show School!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:53.100
Thank you for your applause!

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:57.010
Due to Fire Mufflerlion's effect, 
it's not allowed to attack.

00:08:57.010 --> 00:09:01.620
Odd-Eyes's battles are over for this turn.

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:08.190
Fire Mufflerlion's effect ends, so 
Odd-Eyes's attack points return to normal.

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:12.560
Well done, Odd-Eyes.

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:25.530
No way...

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:28.050
They should be destroyed.

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:29.480
How?

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:31.210
Why?

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:34.700
This is due to Wave King Caesar's effect.

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:35.870
What?

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:46.900
Wave King Caesar uses one Overlay Unit to Special Summon the monsters 
that were destroyed in battle this turn at the end of the Battle Phase.

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:49.690
That means all monsters...

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:52.740
...are resurrected from the graveyard?

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:57.210
Of course, this great reward 
comes with great risk.

00:09:57.210 --> 00:10:07.950
If these Special Summoned monsters are still on my field 
next turn, I take 1000 points of damage for each monster.

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:10.950
He resurrected three monsters.

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:14.290
He has 2300 life points left.

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:16.550
He'll take 3000 points of damage and lose-

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.200
That's not going to happen.

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:21.930
He's not the type who'll lose that easily.

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:26.170
I flip over my trap card 
D/D/D Human Resources!

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:37.870
I return three D/D/D monsters on my field to my 
deck to add two D/D monsters in my deck to my hand.

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:40.270
See?

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:44.670
Now that those monsters are gone, 
he won't take damage next turn.

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:46.750
It's exactly like I said.

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.510
All he did was pull back his monsters.

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:54.990
He said he took a risk for a 
reward, but what's the reward?

00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:57.470
He did add two cards to his hand.

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.230
Those two cards...

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:03.230
Keep it up, Yuya!

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:05.390
Just be yourself!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.950
Do entertainment dueling with a smile!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:14.670
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:17.750
You really are incredible.

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:21.230
Everything you do surpasses my expectations.

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:26.670
I'm looking forward to finding 
out how you'll surprise me next!

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:28.590
How embarrassing.

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:30.670
You've also done well.

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:36.410
I was able to experience what 
Pendulum Summon was like firsthand.

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:39.340
Now you will too.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:46.890
You will find out whether Pendulum Summon 
is a power that only belongs to you!

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:50.690
My turn.  I draw!

00:11:52.190 --> 00:12:00.440
With Scale 1 D/D Savant Galilei 
and Scale 10 D/D Savant Kepler...

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:01.740
What?

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:05.240
I set the Pendulum Scale!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:17.340
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 9 simultaneously!

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:21.390
They're Pendulum Monsters?

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:22.440
Impossible...

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:23.890
No way!

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:34.540
The great power that shakes my soul, reside in my body 
and become the new light that cuts through the darkness!

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:36.800
Pendulum Summon!

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:40.340
Appear, my monsters!

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:58.760
The great power that shakes my soul, reside in my body 
and become the new light that cuts through the darkness!

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:00.760
Pendulum Summon!

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:04.090
Appear, my monsters!

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:09.140
The three ultimate gods 
that rule all the kings!

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:12.990
D/D/D Doom King Armageddons!

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:28.920
Three monsters with 3000 attack points!

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:33.030
Why can he Pendulum?

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:36.840
Go!  Battle, Doom King Armageddon!

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:39.840
Attack Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:45.440
Yuya!

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:54.340
The Action Spell Miracle!

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:06.890
My monster isn't destroyed, 
and battle damage is halved!

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:09.840
A miracle won't occur twice.

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:12.190
You're next, Doom King Armageddon!

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:21.990
Odd-Eyes!

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:26.440
But even if a Pendulum Monster is destroyed, 
it doesn't go to the graveyard.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:30.090
I see.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.390
It goes to the Extra Deck.

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:34.190
So it'll be the same for that one.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:38.340
Do it, Doom King Armageddon!

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:40.870
Attack Fire Mufflerlion!

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:42.340
Where's an Action Card?

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:58.590
2200 points of damage!

00:14:58.590 --> 00:14:59.790
Yuya...

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:02.640
Who is he?

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:04.340
Where did he learn to Pendulum?

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.990
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.440
Impressive, Reiji.

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:16.640
If you've already mastered Pendulum 
Summoning, I don't need You Show School.

00:15:18.090 --> 00:15:21.190
So I'll tear down the school instead.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:26.240
Fusion, Synchro and Xyz also belong to LDS.

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:29.410
I can't believe he can use Pendulum.

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:34.190
How much power does Reiji Akaba have?

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:36.790
Who is he?

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:39.250
What kind of person is he?

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.240
Yuya!  The battle isn't over yet!

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:44.040
Get fired up!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.040
Get your blood boiling!

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:47.890
He's right.

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:49.790
It's still in the middle of a duel.

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:52.690
Calm down.

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:56.290
Don't worry about him.  Winning 
this duel is the priority!

00:15:57.940 --> 00:16:00.640
Those are his Pendulum Monsters.

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.890
But Pendulum was only given to me.

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:06.140
No, don't think about that!

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:08.610
If I don't win, we'll lose the school!

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:10.390
My turn!

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:12.290
I have zero cards in my hand.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:14.590
This draw will determine everything.

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:18.290
I draw!

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:20.690
I drew it!

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:22.860
I'll do it again!

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:24.830
Timegazer!  Stargazer!

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.800
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:30.540
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:35.290
Pendulum Summon!  Come out, my monsters!

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:42.210
Reappear, Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:47.750
Performapal Fire Mufflerlion!

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:54.190
And Performapal Partnaga!

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:59.840
He summoned three at once this time!

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:02.240
Yuya still wants to fight!

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:03.890
Do your best, Yuya!

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:08.570
Partnaga's effect activates 
and targets Odd-Eyes!

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:18.790
When it's Special Summoned, the selected monster 
gains 300 attack points for every Performapal on the field!

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:21.740
There are two Performapals on my field!

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:26.140
300 times 2 equals 600 attack points!

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:29.190
My preparations are complete.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:33.740
First, I'll destroy one using 
my powered-up Odd-Eyes.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:41.040
Due to Odd-Eyes's effect, when it battles a 
Level 5-or-above monster, battle damage is doubled.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:51.050
Next, Mufflerlion's effect increases Odd-Eyes's 
attack points and allows it to attack for a second time.

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:52.390
So I'll destroy the second one!

00:17:56.590 --> 00:18:03.090
By destroying two monsters, I can 
activate my trap card One Two Jump.

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:08.490
Due to its effect, Odd-Eyes 
can attack for a third time.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:13.140
And my opponent's monster's 
attack points will be halved.

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:16.440
He'll have 1500 life points at that time.

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:22.140
If Odd-Eyes destroys the 
third monster, I win!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:25.850
Go!  Battle, Odd-Eyes!

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:27.890
Attack Doom King Armageddon!

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:32.930
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:41.090
When Odd-Eyes battles a Level 5-or-above 
monster, battle damage is doubled!

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:43.040
Reaction Force!

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:54.810
The destroyed Pendulum Monster 
goes to the Extra Deck.

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:57.140
All right!  Next!

00:18:57.140 --> 00:18:59.340
Fire Mufflerlion's effect-

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:02.740
Doom King Armageddon's effect activates!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:03.560
What?

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:12.530
When my monster leaves the field, it gains that 
monster's attack points until the end of the turn.

00:19:12.530 --> 00:19:15.390
Doom King Armageddon has 3000 attack points.

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:20.470
So the two remaining Doom King Armageddons 
gain 3000 attack points each!

00:19:20.810 --> 00:19:24.280
6000 attack points?

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:25.500
Incredible.

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:27.440
Monsters with 6000 attack points...

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:29.250
How are you supposed to destroy it?

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:31.160
And there are two of them.

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:33.490
This will be tough, Yuya.

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:35.610
You Show School will be...

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:36.930
Oh no...

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:42.900
I end my turn.

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:51.440
My turn.  I draw!

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:08.410
What?

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:14.530
His monsters...

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:15.610
...vanished!

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:20.530
It may have something to do with 
his Pendulum Scale shrinking.

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.670
This is an opportunity!

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:29.840
Even if he tries to Pendulum Summon, he 
can only bring out Level 3 and 4 monsters!

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:31.210
Only 3 and 4...

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:38.070
My Partnaga's effect prevents Level 
5-or-below monsters from attacking.

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:42.660
If he only has Level 3 or 4 monsters, 
I can deal with any of them.

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:48.530
Since they're still prototypes, 
they're not stable yet.

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:50.600
But this situation...

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:09.450
Why haven't I noticed until now that 
Pendulum hasn't been perfected?

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:11.250
What?

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:13.160
I see it.

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:16.530
I see that Pendulum Summon 
can evolve even further.

00:21:16.530 --> 00:21:19.160
I'll prove that to you right now.

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:22.630
What's he going to do?

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:24.600
What?

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:29.440
Professor Marco was...

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:31.840
Reiji!

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:34.740
What is it, Nakajima?

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:45.730
Hey!

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:47.190
We'll finish this another time.

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:49.390
Wait!

00:21:49.610 --> 00:21:51.290
What's your name?

00:21:54.130 --> 00:21:56.300
Reiji Akaba.

00:22:04.470 --> 00:22:07.730
Reiji Akaba...

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:19.010
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:28.490
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:40.500
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.760 --> 00:22:45.740
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:46.030 --> 00:22:51.180
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:56.440
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:02.040
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:06.460
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:12.430
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.430 --> 00:23:17.840
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.840 --> 00:23:23.140
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.140 --> 00:23:32.480
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.510 --> 00:23:40.730
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:49.610
Dad, why are you going to duel Yuya?

00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:54.590
Don't interfere!  This will be 
a serious battle between men!

00:23:54.590 --> 00:23:57.210
This place is Showtime Street!

00:23:57.210 --> 00:23:59.330
My dad was an expert on this field.

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:02.300
The principal's Gutsmasters 
are full of fighting spirit!

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:04.640
They don't belong on Showtime Street!

00:24:04.640 --> 00:24:06.930
They're too intense!

00:24:06.930 --> 00:24:11.790
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Hot-Blooded!!  Shuzo Theater

00:24:11.790 --> 00:24:14.070
The fun is only getting started!
